### Get all cards
GET {{host}}/cards

### Get my cards
GET {{host}}/cards/my-cards
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Get specific card
GET {{host}}/cards/{{cardId}}

### Edit card - the user who created the card
PUT {{host}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

