### Like card - any registered user, a second call removes the like
PATCH {{host}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Change the business number of a card - admin only
PATCH {{host}}/cards/{{cardId}}/biz-number
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "bizNumber": 7654321
}

### Delete card - the user who created the card or an admin
DELETE {{host}}/cards/{{cardId}}
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
